.anime_tools_gui.json

# Path rules for a subdirectory go in a .gitignore inside it, not here: ripgrep
# (Grep / Glob / Explore) applies this root file's path-anchored rules only when
# a search starts at the repo root, so ignored files there leak into any search
# started below it. Nested: configs/gui-methods, bench/cjk_{adapter,distill},
# project/finished/{sr,cjk_aware_anima,cjk_aware_anima_dit,…/datasets}.

# Font binaries (CJK lines fetch their own; on main their per-dir ignores are absent).
# The GUI ships Pretendard.
*.ttf
*.otf
*.ttc
!gui/fonts/*.ttf
